  <item>
    <title>Vol.3「破解味道的密码」一个瞬间引发的连环回忆事件</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6413023992b3bc9f1ecde49f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6413023992b3bc9f1ecde49f</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 16 Mar 2023 11:49:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>两周不见波友们！</span></p><span></span><p><span>今日开喝来聊！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">01:15</a> 酸酸甜甜诺曼底苹果酒Cidre</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="206">03:26</a> 法语的味道Parfum/Goût/Odeur/Arôme傻傻分不清</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="304">05:04</a> Parfum和Goût，天然和化学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="435">07:15</a> 酸甜苦辣...鲜?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="503">08:23</a> 偷吃味精初尝鲜果的滋味</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="595">09:55</a> 桑塔纳2000后座的overdose</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="673">11:13</a> Yuan瞬间定位那年夏日家庭午餐桌的别致风味菜单</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="843">14:03</a> Wan一个元素都不能少的外婆挂面团建</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1101">18:21</a> Yuan特别的嗅觉偏好 梦回潮湿温暖的筒子楼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1193">19:53</a> Wan万万没想到是这个气味，一秒巴黎魂穿北京冬夜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1277">21:17</a> 触觉也激活：温柔的小雪花，脚下的碎碎冰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1353">22:33</a> 味道是大脑记忆传送的书签</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1487">24:47</a> 小猫咪能有什么坏心眼呢，不过是散发毛茸茸的味道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1607">26:47</a> 世界上被喜欢着的人都散发着牛奶糖的味道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1630">27:10</a> 到底是谁在巴黎街头偷做那碗，20年前小学后门的一元锅气米线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1845">30:45</a> 寻着味道的线索，找回龙傲天真实的自我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1951">32:31</a> 善用味道的热键，开启对当下的掌控</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2152">35:52</a> 竟然！对着空气怦然心动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2268">37:48</a> 告诉别人她/他/他们今天很香 真的暧昧吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2312">38:32</a> 太容易的爱就不够耐人寻味啦哈哈哈哈哈哈咯咯咯咯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2343">39:03</a> 那么这期也愉快地结束啦！记得留言哦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>谢谢大家收听我们的播客，期待收到大家的反馈，让我们能不断精进说话和剪辑的技艺！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期的最佳美技Nice Play要颁给在剪辑开始渐渐上道的小园，以及爆肝都要完成后期的大碗！降降降降！</span></p><span></span><p><span>虽然这周的巴黎垃圾工人又罢工了，垃圾遍地，但是春暖花开，我们都感觉非常幸福。</span></p><span></span><p><span>还有就是想到五六月份就能回国，见到阔别三年的亲人朋友，就觉得充满了期待呢。</span></p><span></span><p><span>小园 feat. 大碗</span></p><span></span><p><span>3月16日 巴黎 晴</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhYE5Xa2K7JWAQu0URhaXp-AAswS.m4a" length="40880286" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:41:48</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiPU6FYuZH9WB1Xthaz57aimAAkR.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.2「兜兜转转，自我驱动还得靠温柔」回顾当年乱打过鸡血的爽与痛</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/640092c1269dda892932bfc7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">640092c1269dda892932bfc7</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 02 Mar 2023 12:12:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg3naVSMGUtou_yFpUhSjGz1tDKN.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>今日开喝开聊！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="84">01:24</a> 6欧即饮佳酿罗纳河谷Côtes-du-Rhône</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="192">03:12</a> 那些年咕噜咕噜灌下的心情毒鸡汤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="335">05:35</a>鸡血一口闷居然还有快感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="370">06:10</a> Wan 靠着夜夜狂跑10公里的荒谬精神置换</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="543">09:03</a> Yuan少吃再多米也没成为小S</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="824">13:44</a> 拧巴的情绪，一丝不敢放松的人生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> 不加思索的目标只是一场无中生有的大跃进</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1018">16:58</a> 乱打鸡血后果一：能量透支 还要自责无法连续亩产三万斤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1082">18:02</a> 乱打鸡血后果二：盲目执着死板的计划悄然瓦解自信心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1228">20:28</a> 有限的精力，需要根据能量场的波动合理调控</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1262">21:02</a> 乱打鸡血后果三：蒙着双眼自我感动，却来不及思考目的地</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1317">21:57</a> 乱打鸡血后果四：钻进执念，忘记照看应珍视的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1524">25:24</a> 放下工头手里的皮鞭，拥抱受尽恐吓的自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1771">29:31</a> 恐惧不是获得持续力量的必要且充分条件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1990">33:10</a> 放松一下，会发生什么呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2124">35:24</a> 那件我们每个人都应该寻找的东西（没喝多）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a> 夺回设计你独特意义的主动权</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2479">41:19</a> 在记忆里捡起几颗忘记的珍珠</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2580">43:00</a> 不可错过的治愈结尾</span></p><span></span><p><span>截止此刻，第一期已经有400位电波听友与我们从世界各地产生了连接。</span></p><span></span><p><span>接下来的日子里，期待收到更多的来电。</span></p><span></span><p><span>大家有推荐的喝喝好物，</span></p><span></span><p><span>或者想听我们聊聊的话题，</span></p><span></span><p><span>敲我们！</span></p><span></span><p><span>我俩会继续在剪辑工匠的修炼路上快马加鞭，</span></p><span></span><p><span>努力精进音频质量！</span></p><span></span><p><span>大家不吝多多指教 💚</span></p><span></span><p><span>大碗 &amp; 小园</span></p><span></span><p><span>3月2日 巴黎 晴</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/llsvnOC7lgNTzma26srF6v-YmbPa.m4a" length="42946874" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:43:55</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiPU6FYuZH9WB1Xthaz57aimAAkR.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.1「命运是人生所有决定的总和」留法8年，记忆重现，当初离开故乡的秘密</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63ee17be51a4e4150a9b4ed2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63ee17be51a4e4150a9b4ed2</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 16 Feb 2023 11:47:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="114">01:54</a> 无法回避的问题，自己都不信的答案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="426">07:06</a> 绿色桌布上写下的神秘符号居然成真</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="541">09:01</a> Wan最早的种子，生活在别处和法国幻象的源头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="713">11:53</a> Yuan移民背景让离开家乡的生活习以为常</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="760">12:40</a> 米老鼠的诱惑让我踏上离开的旅程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1182">19:42</a> Wan高考真正的志愿原来是离开舒适圈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1426">23:46</a> Yuan只想做夜空里最特别的那一颗星</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1873">31:13</a> 生命里的那位男人留下的宝贵知识财富</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2092">34:52</a> 激情创业思潮又添一笔线索</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2276">37:56</a> Yuan天坑专业出门左转延迟就业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2550">42:30</a> 殊途同归，命运是所有选择的总和</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2726">45:26</a> 成长的守恒公式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2823">47:03</a> 不要让恐惧阻止你走向真正的自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2887">48:07</a> 拨开记忆的迷雾，看似随机，但一切都有迹可循</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2921">48:41</a> 一定不能错过的治愈结尾</span></p><span></span><p><span>第一集发布成功！手忙脚乱但是无比开心！</span></p><span></span><p><span>音频新手起步，大家多多指教，我们会不断学习继续进步！</span></p><span></span><p><span>也欢迎大家留言跟我俩即刻分享你们的故事和记忆。</span></p><span></span><p><span>一起探索命运的轨迹，</span></p><span></span><p><span>走向真正的自己。</span></p><span></span><p><span>小园 &amp; 大碗 💌</span></p><span></span><p><span>2月16日 巴黎 晴</span></p>]]></description>
